===Etymology===
[[File:Miscanthus field - geograph.org.uk - 643482.jpg|thumb|A [[field#Noun|field]] of [[elephant grass]] or {{vern|giant miscanthus}} ({{taxlink|Miscanthus × giganteus|variety|ver=20230225}}) in [[Parkham]] in [[Devon]], [[England]], United Kingdom, which is grown as biomass ''({{senseno|en|fuel}})''.]]

From {{prefix|en|bio|pos1={{glossary|prefix}} denoting organic life|mass|t2=matter, material}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=n|id=273676|date=December 2021|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|pos=n}}</ref>

